title ADLC Org Status Rollout

participant "Program Owner" as Owner
participant "ADLC Plugin" as Plugin
participant "GitHub MCP or gh" as GitHub
participant "Org Status Repo" as StatusRepo
participant "Repo Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Repo Worker" as Worker
participant "Target Repo" as Target
participant ".adlc Harness" as Harness
participant "Metrics Aggregator" as Metrics

Owner->Plugin: Create or update org ADLC status repo
Plugin->GitHub: Check connector and permissions
GitHub-->Plugin: Org access and repo search result

alt Status repo missing
  Plugin->GitHub: Create repo
  GitHub-->Plugin: Repo URL
  Plugin->StatusRepo: Commit starter layout
else Status repo exists
  Plugin->StatusRepo: Pull latest layout
end

Owner->Inventory: Provide repo list
Plugin->Inventory: Normalize repos.yaml

loop For each target repo, preferably in parallel-capable batches
  Plugin->Worker: Assign repo and output path
  Worker->Target: Confirm platform plugin install
  Worker->Harness: Initialize or refresh .adlc only
  Worker->Target: Detect existing .claude/.codex/.augment/Superpowers harnesses
  Worker->Harness: Record detected harnesses and lifecycle status
  Worker->Target: Run org standards
  Target-->Worker: reports, .adlc/status.md, lifecycle, proof notes
  Worker->StatusRepo: Copy run snapshot
  Worker->StatusRepo: Refresh latest snapshot
end

Plugin->Metrics: Aggregate latest reports
Metrics->StatusRepo: Write metrics/org-metrics.json
Metrics->StatusRepo: Write metrics/org-metrics.md
Metrics->StatusRepo: Write dashboard markdown
Plugin-->Owner: Report coverage, security, gaps, quick wins, and next plan
